{
  "about": "The scene set of the card probe (ticket 11). A scene is one stored call of tmp/lt15/new/trial-1 (story A). `input` replaces the <LastMessage> of a Narration call. `direction` adds a <LastMessage> to an Impersonate call, as the engine sends a Player direction. `facts` are the card facts and secrets that no Character outside `known_to` has learned at that point of the story (checked with `card_probe.py check`). `focus` are the Characters whose portrayal the judge checks against the card. `met` are the Characters that Julian has already met, for the repeated first meeting.",
